| P-085 | Panel lifecycle | One shared panel; the front file pane owns it while it is first responder; the panel reloads when the selection changes, closes on navigation away, and survives tab switches by retargeting. | Partial (F-049; B-060 no reload on selection change; C-21 previews invisible selection; `performQuickLook` menu chain unreachable) | P0 | S | `QLPreviewPanel.shared()`, `acceptsPreviewPanelControl`, `beginPreviewPanelControl`, `reloadData()`, `QLPreviewPanelDataSource` | UI | Data source must read the committed snapshot, including nested list items (B-033). |
