| P-170 | Scope bar | Typing in the toolbar field turns the window into a search with a scope bar: "This Mac", "<current folder>", "Shared"; the default scope is a setting (This Mac / current folder / previous scope). | Partial (F-043 current folder only, no selector; Recent searches "everywhere") | P0 | M | `NSMetadataQuery.searchScopes` (`NSMetadataQueryLocalComputerScope`, folder URLs, `NSMetadataQueryNetworkScope`) | Search, UI | B-024 turns the symbolic scope into a path today; keep scopes as enum cases until the query is built. |
