| P-185 | Find window | ⌘F with no window open (or from the Desktop) opens a new search window at This Mac. | No | P2 | S | New window with search active | UI | |
| P-186 | System Recents | Finder's Recents is a Spotlight query on `kMDItemLastUsedDate` across the Mac, sorted by last opened. Helm's Recent is an app-local log. | Partial (F-030; B-030 order lost) | P1 | M | `NSMetadataQuery` with `kMDItemLastUsedDate > now-30d` and `kMDItemContentTypeTree != folder` | Search, Core | Keep Helm's Recent (identity) and add "Recents (All Apps)" as a second place; label both clearly. |

