| P-219 | Third-party providers | Dropbox, OneDrive, Google Drive, Box appear under Locations as "Cloud storage" with folders under `~/Library/CloudStorage/<Provider-Account>`; dataless items show a cloud badge. | No | P1 | M | Enumerate `~/Library/CloudStorage`; dataless detection via `stat` `st_flags & SF_DATALESS` `[Needs verification on macOS]`; `NSFileProviderManager` is for the provider, not for Helm | FS, UI | Never read a dataless file's contents during listing or thumbnailing. |
| P-220 | Avoid accidental materialization | Finder lists and thumbnails cloud folders without downloading everything. | No | P1 | S | `setiopolicy_np(IOPOL_TYPE_VFS_MATERIALIZE_DATALESS_FILES, IOPOL_SCOPE_PROCESS, IOPOL_MATERIALIZE_DATALESS_FILES_OFF)` at launch `[Needs verification on macOS]`; skip thumbnails for dataless items | App, FS | Reading a dataless file with the policy off returns `EDEADLK`; map to "not downloaded". |
| P-221 | Optimize Mac Storage interplay | Finder shows eviction state and "Optimize" settings. | No | P2 | S | Status keys above | UI | Informational only. |
| P-222 | Remove-from-iCloud warning | Setting: warn before removing an item from iCloud Drive. | No | P2 | S | Preflight when the source is in the iCloud container and the destination is not | Ops | |
| P-223 | Desktop & Documents in iCloud | When enabled, Desktop and Documents are inside iCloud Drive and Finder shows them there. | No | P2 | S | Detect by resolving the real paths | FS | Helm's Favorites should still show them as Desktop and Documents. |
| P-224 | Conflicts and versions | Per-app "Browse all versions"; Finder shows nothing. | n/a | P2 | S | `NSFileVersion` exists but is per-document | — | Out of scope. |

