| P-290 | Trash state badge | Dock Trash icon is full or empty; Finder's sidebar shows a full/empty icon. | No | P2 | S | Count from `TrashSource` | UI | The Dock icon belongs to the Dock and reflects Finder's view; Helm cannot change it. |
